# Allowlist: Vercel builds and bundles only what the app needs at runtime.
# Excluding everything first means a new secret file (.env.*, a token handoff
# file, a key) can never reach a deployment by being forgotten here.
*

!app
# `*` also matches every file inside app/, so re-include its contents too.
!app/**
!vercel.json
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!requirements.txt
!README.md

# Never ship these, even from inside app/.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pem
**/*-key.json
**/credentials*.json
